**This port serves as a template/example** for users to adapt to their own BSP and target hardware. The port has been verified to run successfully in QEMU emulation with full networking functionality. Users should:
1. Adapt the build configuration to their specific RTEMS BSP
2. Modify `ionrtems.c` for their hardware platform requirements
3. Adjust memory configurations and resource limits as needed
4. Initialize system clock appropriately for their platform
5. Ensure MAX_SPAWNS is set to 32 or higher for full daemon support
