## Archive: Notes for RTEMS 5.1 port of ION 4.1.2

This section preserved for historical reference. See above for current RTEMS 6.1 ARM64 port.

This port followed the basic features scope and approach of previous ION 3.6 port with the following changes:

* Updates to RTEMS 5.1 release
* Updates port from BPv6 to BPv7
* Updates RTEMS build system from `make` to `waf`, builds individual libraries
* Target: sparc/erc32 (32-bit system)
* Does not include CFDP and NM modules

